{"id":"n70664-1-11","stage":5,"title":"여지 · 余地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70664-1-11-1","ko":"왜 승규가 도둑으로 의심을 받는 거야?","zh":"为什么承奎会被怀疑是小偷啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"승규가","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}},{"text":"도둑으로","meaning":"小偷，盗贼，窃贼","explanation":"도둑：小偷，盗贼，窃贼；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"도둑","audio":"/audio/9eaab0702752d6341042.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47813","senseId":"2","lemma":"도둑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도둑으로","audio":"/audio/7040f384edb4b2b137d7.mp3"}},{"text":"의심을","meaning":"疑心，怀疑","explanation":"의심：疑心，怀疑；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"의심","audio":"/audio/77f0499ee995a056f4cc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24090","senseId":"1","lemma":"의심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"의심을","audio":"/audio/e014af4c918c7c837904.mp3"}},{"text":"받는","meaning":"受到，遭到，得到","explanation":"받다：受到，遭到，得到；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"7","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받는","audio":"/audio/018f33537240ab51d15e.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"9eaab0702752d634","term":"도둑","zh":"小偷，盗贼，窃贼","audio":"/audio/9eaab0702752d6341042.mp3","entryId":"47813","definition":"窃取或抢夺别人的东西的人。","pronunciation":["도둑"]},{"id":"77f0499ee995a056","term":"의심","zh":"疑心，怀疑","audio":"/audio/77f0499ee995a056f4cc.mp3","entryId":"24090","definition":"认为不确定或无法相信的心情。","pronunciation":["의심"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"受到，遭到，得到","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"某一情况涉及到自己。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/0e7b2f7b3646c22b2421.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70664-1-11-2","ko":"교실에 혼자 남아 있었으니까 의심받을 여지는 충분하지.","zh":"因为他独自留在教室里，所以完全有被怀疑的余地。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"교실에","meaning":"教室","explanation":"교실：教室；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"교실","audio":"/audio/ed3c8c7f5e586d363644.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64472","senseId":"1","lemma":"교실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"교실에","audio":"/audio/4fb7933e1351bcdded0d.mp3"}},{"text":"혼자","meaning":"独自，单独","explanation":"혼자：独自，单独","readings":[{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30207","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}},{"text":"남아","meaning":"留，留下","explanation":"남다：留，留下；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"4","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남아",